    for _ in range(2, n + 1):
        prev, curr = curr, prev + curr
    return curr
```
```java
public int climbStairs(int n) {
    int prev = 1, curr = 1;
    for (int i = 2; i <= n; i++) {
        int next = prev + curr;
        prev = curr;
        curr = next;
    }
    return curr;
}
```

**Time O(n) · Space O(1).** Naive recursion is O(2ⁿ) — say that, then show the fix.

