### 15.2 House Robber

*Can't rob adjacent houses. Maximum total?*

**Recursion:** at each house, `max(rob it + best from i-2, skip it and take best from i-1)`.

```javascript
function rob(nums) {
  let twoBack = 0, oneBack = 0;
  for (const n of nums) {
    [twoBack, oneBack] = [oneBack, Math.max(oneBack, twoBack + n)];
  }
  return oneBack;
}
```
```python
