    two_back, one_back = 0, 0
    for n in nums:
        two_back, one_back = one_back, max(one_back, two_back + n)
    return one_back
```
```java
public int rob(int[] nums) {
    int twoBack = 0, oneBack = 0;
    for (int n : nums) {
        int take = twoBack + n;
        twoBack = oneBack;
        oneBack = Math.max(oneBack, take);
    }
    return oneBack;
}
