## 29.28 Scheduling and async

```java
@Configuration @EnableScheduling
class SchedulingConfig { }

@Component
public class Jobs {
    @Scheduled(fixedDelay = 60_000)
    void pollQueue() { ... }

    @Scheduled(cron = "0 0 2 * * *", zone = "Africa/Cairo")
    void nightlyReport() { ... }
