### 2. Check if a string is a palindrome
```javascript
function isPalindrome(s) {
  const clean = s.toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]/g, "");
  return clean === [...clean].reverse().join("");
}
```

### 3. Find the largest number in an array
```javascript
